[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14040.229, "timestamp": "03:54:00", "text": "苏利耶。好的。好的。你的说法不对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14042.79, "timestamp": "03:54:02", "text": "你不。好的。好的。好的。你的名字"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14045.429, "timestamp": "03:54:05", "text": "是指太阳，对吧？好的。那挺好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14048.71, "timestamp": "03:54:08", "text": "我刚才确实担心了一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14062.79, "timestamp": "03:54:22", "text": "没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14064.229, "timestamp": "03:54:24", "text": "还有，呃，是什么让你开始的呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14065.83, "timestamp": "03:54:25", "text": "在 YouTube 上吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14070.15, "timestamp": "03:54:30", "text": "啊，呃，其实这可能有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14073.75, "timestamp": "03:54:33", "text": "有点尴尬。当我看到Kisuna AI时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14076.469, "timestamp": "03:54:36", "text": "起初，我以为它就像人工智能一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14078.309, "timestamp": "03:54:38", "text": "实际上是一种人工智能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14081.189, "timestamp": "03:54:41", "text": "并非配音演员。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14083.11, "timestamp": "03:54:43", "text": "一阵怪异的气氛，直到有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14085.11, "timestamp": "03:54:45", "text": "向我解释说：“不，那是人的声音。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14086.63, "timestamp": "03:54:46", "text": "表演。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14089.03, "timestamp": "03:54:49", "text": "然后我就弄明白了所有东西是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14091.99, "timestamp": "03:54:51", "text": "其他东西我也都检查过了。我已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14094.469, "timestamp": "03:54:54", "text": "Niji 开始做 YouTube 的时候，我就开始做 YouTube 了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14098.389, "timestamp": "03:54:58", "text": "山治已经失败了，你知道的。"}]